# Packages present in src/ that are not released, and why.
#
# One name per line, optionally followed by a reason. Point gen_release_set.sh at this file with
# EXCLUDE=<path>, or copy it to exclude.txt beside the script.
#
# A package with no <duatic_archive_root> is reported as "unrouted" and withheld: that is the
# oversight case. This file is the deliberate case, and covers packages in repositories you do not
# own and therefore cannot annotate.
#
# <package>            <reason>
#
# some_upstream_pkg    the public ROS index already provides it
# some_example_pkg     a composition of released packages, not a deliverable
